{"ref":"BDB, פָּרַס","hw":"פָּרַס","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרַס</span></big><sub>28</sub>  <strong>n.pr.terr. Persia</strong>, Περσῶν (genit.), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:2\" href=\"/Daniel.11.2\">Dn 11:2</a> τῇ Περσίδι (𝔊 et Θ), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.20\">2 Ch 36:20</a> Μήδων <strong>(</strong>OPers. <em>Pârsa</em>, <em>Persian, Persia</em>, Spieg<sup>APK 231</sup>, NPers. <span dir=\"rtl\">پَارْسِ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">فَارْسِ</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">فَارِسُ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.22\">2 Ch 36:22</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרָ֑ס</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.20\">20</a> +;—in late lit., <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.20\">2 Ch 36:20</a>, v <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.22\">22</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.23\">23</a> = <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:1\" href=\"/Ezra.1.1\">Ezr 1:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:2\" href=\"/Ezra.1.2\">2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:1\" href=\"/Daniel.10.1\">Dn 10:1</a> + 11 times Ezr Dn + (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָדַי</span>) <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:3\" href=\"/Esther.1.3\">Est 1:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:14\" href=\"/Esther.1.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:18\" href=\"/Esther.1.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:19\" href=\"/Esther.1.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 10:2\" href=\"/Esther.10.2\">10:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:20\" href=\"/Daniel.8.20\">Dn 8:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.10\">Ez 27:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.5\">38:5</a> is doubted by Toy (who, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.10\">27:10</a>, reads <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוּשׁ</span>, after Gr), but Krae defends.","next":"BDB, פַּרְסִי","prev":"BDB, פַּרְנָךְ"}